message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "BuildLang"
abstract: "BuildLang (buildc v1.15.0) is a deterministic systems and GPU language whose function types declare side effects (Console, FileSystem, Network, FFI). It compiles across 12 CPU and GPU targets (C, LLVM IR, x86-64, ARM64, RISC-V 64, WebAssembly, SPIR-V, HLSL, GLSL, WGSL, Apple Metal MSL, Rust), ships BuildDB/BuildQL (qdb), BuildTeX verified PDFs, a certified V5 e-graph superoptimizer, and GPU polyhedral translation validation."
version: "1.15.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
